<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="gems">
      <image wx:for="{{gems}}" wx:key="*this" class="gem g{{index}}" src="/assets/gems/{{item}}.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
    <view class="title">璀璨宝石</view>
    <view class="sub">SPLENDOR · 收集宝石，赢得贵族青睐</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{hasSave}}" class="resume" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onResume">
    <image class="resume-icon" src="/assets/backs/tier2.svg" mode="scaleToFill" />
    <view class="resume-text">
      <text class="resume-title">继续上局</text>
      <text class="resume-sub">对局已自动保存</text>
    </view>
    <text class="resume-go">›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="label">玩家人数</view>
    <view class="seg">
      <view wx:for="{{[2, 3, 4]}}" wx:key="*this" class="seg-item {{count === item ? 'on' : ''}}" data-n="{{item}}" bindtap="onCount">
        <text class="num">{{item}}</text> 人
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="label gap">座位 · 按出手顺序</view>
    <view wx:for="{{seats}}" wx:if="{{index < count}}" class="seat">
      <view class="avatar av-{{index}}">{{index + 1}}</view>
      <input class="seat-name" value="{{item.name}}" maxlength="8" placeholder="输入名字" placeholder-class="ph" data-i="{{index}}" bindinput="onName" />
      <view class="type" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="onToggleAI">
        <view class="type-opt {{item.isAI ? '' : 'on'}}">真人</view>
        <view class="type-opt {{item.isAI ? 'on' : ''}}">电脑</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="tip">多名真人时为同屏轮流模式，轮到谁就把手机交给谁。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn primary start" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onStart">开始新游戏</view>
  <view class="link" bindtap="onRules">玩法说明</view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{showRules}}" class="mask" bindtap="onRules">
  <view class="dialog rules" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="dialog-title">玩法说明</view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="rules-body">
      <view class="h">目标</view>
      <view class="p">率先达到 <text class="em">15</text> 声望。有人达到后打完本轮，分最高者胜；平分时发展卡较少者胜。</view>
      <view class="h">每回合选一个动作</view>
      <view class="p"><text class="em">①</text> 拿 3 枚不同颜色的宝石（桌上不足 3 种时拿满剩余种类）。</view>
      <view class="p"><text class="em">②</text> 拿 2 枚同色宝石（该色剩余 ≥ 4 枚时才可）。再点一次已选的宝石即可切换。</view>
      <view class="p"><text class="em">③</text> 预留 1 张发展卡（场上或盲抽牌堆），并获得 1 枚黄金。最多预留 3 张。</view>
      <view class="p"><text class="em">④</text> 购买 1 张场上或自己预留的发展卡。黄金可当任意颜色。</view>
      <view class="h">永久加成</view>
      <view class="p">每张已购发展卡永久提供 1 颗右上角颜色的宝石，自动抵扣之后的购买成本。</view>
      <view class="h">贵族</view>
      <view class="p">回合结束时，若你的加成满足某位贵族的要求，他会自动来访，带来 3 声望（每回合至多一位）。</view>
      <view class="h">代币上限</view>
      <view class="p">回合结束时手中代币（含黄金）不得超过 10 枚，超出须自选弃回。</view>
      <view class="h">操作提示</view>
      <view class="p">买得起的卡会发出绿光；点卡牌可看到每种宝石怎么付、还差多少；点对手头像查看其详情。</view>
    </scroll-view>
    <view class="btn primary wide" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onRules">知道了</view>
  </view>
</view>
